OL,3,GNEWSAWho is by-election winner Sagal
OL,4,AAbdi-Wali?
OL,5,
OL,6,FSagal Abdi-Wali won Thursday's Holborn
OL,7,Fand St Pancras by-election, becoming
OL,8,Fthe first British Somali person to
OL,9,Fbecome an MP.
OL,11,FAbdi-Wali, 42, who came to the UK from
OL,12,FSomalia as a child refugee with her
OL,13,Ffamily in the 1990s, grew up in Camden,
OL,14,Fworked for Camden Council as a housing
OL,15,Fofficer and was elected as a councillor
OL,16,Fin 2022.
OL,18,FShe became leader of the local
OL,19,Fauthority in May and Labour made much
OL,20,Fof her local roots during the election
OL,21,Fcampaign.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
